# Spring-Loaded Sawblades // Bladewheel Chariot. With flash the Sawblades are cast as Bot2 attacks with two Ornithopters:
# "it deals 5 damage to target tapped creature an opponent controls" may not target Bot1's own Llanowar Elves, tapped for
# the mana (refused), and kills an attacking Ornithopter. On turn five they craft with a Mox Emerald (Craft with artifact
# {3}{W}) into Bladewheel Chariot, a 5/5 Vehicle. On turn seven "Tap two other untapped artifacts you control: This Vehicle
# becomes an artifact creature until end of turn" taps two Moxen and it attacks. On turn nine, with only one other artifact
# untapped, that ability is not offered (the Chariot itself is no other artifact: refused), and Crew 1 with the Elves is.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Spring-Loaded Sawblades
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x20

